# Team domains

Kidus (repo admin) owns:

- `mobile/` — Flutter app
- Database / ORM — schema, models, and migrations for Supabase PostgreSQL (`DATABASE_URL`)

A separate **Django developer** owns most of `backend/`: REST API, views, serializers, permissions, Chapa webhooks, Swagger, Celery, and app wiring. Do not generate that unless Kidus explicitly asks.

Do not generate React (`web/`) unless he explicitly asks.

When doing database work, stop at models/migrations (and ledger integrity constraints). Leave endpoints and business-view logic for the Django teammate.

Default for UI work is Flutter. Default for persistence is Django ORM against Postgres, not Hive-as-source-of-truth and not a Flutter SQL connection.

Git: day-to-day work merges into `prototype`, not `main`. Never list Cursor as a contributor or co-author.
